==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the first Dark Otter fast with units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] before Bun Bun Symbiote arrives. Lure him to the base and use units like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] to stop him while you use Fishman to chip him down, or use [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to chain Bun Bun Symbiote.

